    "title": "Dataset for the publication: Non-oxidative dehydrogenation of methanol to dimethoxymethane over Ag/Hβ zeolite bifunctional catalyst",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15691695",
    "publication_date": "2025-06-18",
    "description": "<p>The dataset covers the research data of the publication in Catalysis Sience &amp; Technology with the title \"Non-oxidative dehydrogenation of methanol to dimethoxymethane over Ag/H&beta; zeolite bifunctional catalyst\" (DOI: 10.1039/d5cy00544b). The provided data comprehend the main experimental data obtained in the study including material characterisation (XRD, UV-VIS, TG, H2-TPD, XPS, N2 physisorption) and the catalytic data of the investigated Ag-loaded zeolites in a continuous gas-phase fixed-bed reactor.</p>",
